  "priorResearchClarification": "Earlier preflight had distinct view(-y),clip(+y) and viewport(.25y) exercises. The proposed main teaching chain now uses one consistently identified point throughout; separate axis/viewport challenges must be labeled explicitly.",
  "sourceCaveats": [
    "Preserve row/column,forward-axis,clip-depth and screen-origin conventions independently; API name alone is insufficient.",
    "Near-zero positive z gives small w and large1/w, not largew.",
    "Homogeneous clipping precedes divide; outside vertex does not discard the entire crossing triangle.",
    "Image normalized depth is not metric forward distance; ordinary float formats do not imply uniform distance precision.",
    "w-buffering is historical context; orthographic w1 carries no useful depth by itself.",
